/datum/lore/character_background/citizenship/species/scori/empire
	name = "Scorian Empire"
	id = "citizenship_scori_empire"
	category = "Surt"
	desc = "The imperial core to which all scorians in the local region of Surt have found themselves subject to. \
    Closer to the capital the technological level rapidly increases, equalling something about on par with human civilization \
    on terra in the 17th century. This has given them a position of strength sufficient enough to negotiate with Nanotrasen \
    as well as to claim so many lands in the first place. Imperial culture remains a relative mystery as they prefer to leave \
    the daily dealings with outsiders to their subjects, only sending officials when matters of importance arise."
